<div id="ex-latex-settings-modal" class="ex-submodal-overlay hidden" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="GitHub Actions 编译池配置">
    <div class="ex-submodal-box ex-settings-dialog-box">
      <div class="ex-submodal-header">
        <div class="ex-submodal-title">
          <md-icon class="ex-submodal-icon">settings</md-icon>
          <span>GitHub Actions 编译池凭证设置</span>
        </div>
        <md-icon-button type="button" class="ex-submodal-close" id="ex-close-settings-modal-btn" aria-label="关闭">
          <md-icon>close</md-icon>
        </md-icon-button>
      </div>
      <div class="ex-settings-dialog-body">
        <div class="ex-settings-field">
          <label for="ex-gh-token-input">
            <span>GitHub Personal Access Token (PAT)</span>
            <a href="https://github.com/settings/tokens/new?scopes=repo,workflow" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="ex-link-tip">获取 Token ↗</a>
          </label>
          <input type="password" id="ex-gh-token-input" class="ex-input" placeholder="ghp_xxxxxxxxxxxx (Classic 勾选 repo，细粒度需 actions/contents)" autocomplete="off" />
          <span class="ex-field-hint">私密凭证，仅保存在当前浏览器的 LocalStorage，绝不经过本站后端服务器</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ex-settings-field">
          <label for="ex-gh-repo-input">编译调度仓库</label>
          <input type="text" id="ex-gh-repo-input" class="ex-input" placeholder="Ariesagittarius/AstroLib" value="Ariesagittarius/AstroLib" />
          <span class="ex-field-hint">承载 XeLaTeX 编译工作流的目标 GitHub 仓库（所有者/仓库名）</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ex-settings-field">
          <label for="ex-gh-transport-mode-select">源码传输模式</label>
          <select id="ex-gh-transport-mode-select" class="ex-input">
            <option value="auto">自适应（依据文档体积选择 Gzip 压缩流或 Git Blob 对象）</option>
            <option value="gzip">Gzip 压缩流（单次调度，需 actions:write 权限）</option>
            <option value="blob">Git Blob 对象（解除参数长度约束，需 contents:write 权限）</option>
          </select>
          <span class="ex-field-hint">
            Gzip 模式通过工作流调度参数传输；Git Blob 模式将源码写入 Git 对象数据库后传递散列标识。
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="ex-settings-note">
          凭证权限：Gzip 模式需 Token 具备 actions:write 权限；Git Blob 模式需包含 contents:write 权限（或具有完整 repo 范围的经典 Token）。
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ex-submodal-footer ex-settings-dialog-footer">
        <md-outlined-button type="button" id="ex-cancel-settings-btn">取消</md-outlined-button>
        <md-filled-button type="button" id="ex-gh-save-config-btn">保存并应用</md-filled-button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
